1
00:00:08,934 --> 00:00:12,848
It hurts, doesn't it?

2
00:00:12,848 --> 00:00:14,890
You'll feel better tomorrow, Betty, believe me.

3
00:00:14,890 --> 00:00:19,868
Only one day, and it won't hurt as much.

4
00:00:19,868 --> 00:00:20,846
Do you feel like eating?

5
00:00:20,846 --> 00:00:23,824
Having some dinner?

6
00:00:23,824 --> 00:00:26,544
Oh, don't look so sad.

7
00:00:26,544 --> 00:00:27,802
Let me tell you about your dinner.

8
00:00:27,802 --> 00:00:29,780
It's ice cream.

9
00:00:29,780 --> 00:00:30,740
Ice cream.

10
00:00:30,740 --> 00:00:37,736
All kinds of flavors.

11
00:00:37,736 --> 00:00:38,236
Chocolate.

12
00:00:38,236 --> 00:00:38,714
Strawberry?

13
00:00:38,714 --> 00:00:39,211
Vanilla?

14
00:00:39,211 --> 00:00:40,204
Vanilla, too?

15
00:00:40,204 --> 00:00:42,919
I see you're feeling better already, Betty.

16
00:00:42,919 --> 00:00:44,669
So you will have dinner?

17
00:00:44,669 --> 00:00:48,433
OK, honey, we'll see to it

18
00:00:48,433 --> 00:00:50,625
that you have strawberry and vanilla ice cream.

19
00:00:50,625 --> 00:00:51,842
Just rest now.

20
00:00:51,842 --> 00:00:59,559
You need some rest to help you get better quickly.

21
00:00:59,559 --> 00:01:02,537
Hi, Frank.

22
00:01:02,537 --> 00:01:05,515
How you doing?

23
00:01:05,515 --> 00:01:08,748
Oh, come on now.

24
00:01:08,748 --> 00:01:10,275
You're a big boy.

25
00:01:10,275 --> 00:01:15,503
It doesn't hurt that much, does it?

26
00:01:15,503 --> 00:01:17,963
Oh, I'm sorry it hurts so much,

27
00:01:17,963 --> 00:01:18,427
and you won't be able to have dinner.

28
00:01:18,427 --> 00:01:24,623
You're just going to have to have ice cream.

29
00:01:24,623 --> 00:01:26,483
Yes, ice cream.

30
00:01:26,483 --> 00:01:26,683
Lots of flavors.

31
00:01:26,483 --> 00:01:30,239
Want to hear them?

32
00:01:30,239 --> 00:01:30,539
Chocolate?

33
00:01:30,539 --> 00:01:32,317
Then chocolate it is.

34
00:01:32,317 --> 00:01:34,031
One scoop or two?

35
00:01:34,031 --> 00:01:34,888
Three scoops?

36
00:01:34,888 --> 00:01:44,229
Then three it will be.

37
00:01:44,229 --> 00:01:46,229
You want three scoops also?

38
00:01:46,229 --> 00:01:47,207
Chocolate, too?

39
00:01:47,207 --> 00:01:51,225
Well, I see you're feeling better.

40
00:01:51,225 --> 00:01:55,163
Well, at least you're acting like you feel better.

41
00:01:55,163 --> 00:02:05,074
Three scoops of chocolate ice cream for Tim coming up.

42
00:02:05,074 --> 00:02:08,052
Hi, Carl.

43
00:02:08,052 --> 00:02:11,030
How you doing?

44
00:02:11,030 --> 00:02:14,008
I know it hurts.

45
00:02:14,008 --> 00:02:17,653
But it'll be better tomorrow.

46
00:02:17,653 --> 00:02:21,964
In the meantime, what would you like?

47
00:02:21,964 --> 00:02:22,297
Surprise.

48
00:02:22,297 --> 00:02:22,942
A surprise?

49
00:02:22,942 --> 00:02:25,920
I promised you a surprise, didn't I?

50
00:02:25,920 --> 00:02:28,898
And it wasn't just ice cream, was it?

51
00:02:28,898 --> 00:02:31,876
Your birthday is tomorrow, isn't it?

52
00:02:31,876 --> 00:02:35,425
Well, maybe, just maybe,

53
00:02:35,425 --> 00:02:37,832
there will be a surprise.

54
00:02:37,832 --> 00:02:40,810
But first you have to smile.

55
00:02:40,810 --> 00:02:46,766
I just want to see one smile from you.

56
00:02:46,766 --> 00:02:49,744
No smile, no surprise.

57
00:02:49,744 --> 00:02:52,722
That's the deal.

58
00:02:52,722 --> 00:02:54,722
No smile, no surprise.

59
00:02:54,722 --> 00:02:56,043
If you want a surprise,

60
00:02:56,043 --> 00:03:16,878
then you've got to smile first.

61
00:03:16,878 --> 00:03:19,523
How you all doing ?

62
00:03:19,523 --> 00:03:23,534
Well, I'm glad you're feeling better

63
00:03:23,534 --> 00:03:24,501
because we have a little surprise for you today.

64
00:03:24,501 --> 00:03:25,479
It's Carl's birthday,

65
00:03:25,479 --> 00:03:28,206
and we have Popo the Clown to entertain you.

66
00:03:28,206 --> 00:03:30,837
And here he is--Popo the Clown.

67
00:03:30,837 --> 00:04:57,796
Happy birthday, Carl.

68
00:04:57,796 --> 00:04:58,948
Happy birthday.

69
00:04:58,948 --> 00:05:00,774
All right, everybody.

70
00:05:00,774 --> 00:05:02,224
OK, Carl.

71
00:05:02,224 --> 00:05:04,392
It's your birthday.

72
00:05:04,392 --> 00:05:06,339
What 's your wish?

73
00:05:06,339 --> 00:05:07,730
What would you like?

74
00:05:07,730 --> 00:05:09,708
Hmm?

75
00:05:09,708 --> 00:05:12,708
You want to play charades?
